OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 31, dies while in police
OL,4,Acustody
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has died while in
OL,7,Fpolice custody.
OL,9,FParamedics were called to Middlesbrough
OL,10,Fpolice station on Thursday morning at
OL,11,Fabout 06:00 GMT, where the man was
OL,12,Fpronounced dead an hour later.
OL,14,FCleveland Police said the family of the
OL,15,Fdetainee had been informed and it had
OL,16,Freferred itself to the Independent
OL,17,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC).
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
