OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 31, dies while in police
OL,4,Acustody
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IOPC said its initial investigation
OL,7,Findicated the man was arrested just
OL,8,Fbefore 22:00 on Wednesday and was put
OL,9,Fon half-hourly checks by custody
OL,10,Fdetention staff.
